1. four things you wear on your feet;
2. five things that keep you warm;
3. two things you wear in hot (cold) weather;
4. three things that only women wear;
5. six things that men and women can both wear.

tasks.solution:
1. four things you wear on your feet: boots, sneakers, shoes, slippers;
2. five things that keep you warm: sweater, scarf, jacket, mittens, boots;
3. two things you wear in hot (cold) weather: T-shirt, shorts; cold weather: jacket, jeans;
4. three things that only women wear: skirt, dress, tights;
5. six things that men and women can both wear: jeans, T-shirt, shorts, cap, sneakers, trousers.
