tasks.condition:
Name:
1. some domestic animals and birds;
2. animals and birds that can be wild and domestic;
3. animals that live only in hot countries;
4. animals that eat only grass, vegetables and fruit;
5. some animals that are quicker than the tortoise;
6. some animals that are bigger than the cat;
7. some animals that can have different colours;
8. the most beautiful animal.

tasks.solution:
1. some domestic animals and birds: cats, dogs, a parrot, raccoon;
2. animals and birds that can be wild and domestic: raccoon, monkeys, lizard;
3. animals that live only in hot countries: lion, giraffe, tiger, crocodile, gorillas, colibri, zebra, chameleon;
4. animals that eat only grass, vegetables and fruit: monkeys, chameleons, goat, sheep, horse, elephant, hippo, camel, giraffe, zebra;
5. some animals that are quicker than the tortoise: all animals;
6. some animals that are bigger that the cat: dog, horse, hippo, zebra, lion, tiger;
